# =============================================================================
# FamLink API — environment variables
# =============================================================================
#
# There is intentionally ONE env template for the whole monorepo: the repo-root
# `.env.example`. It documents every variable the API validates in
# `apps/api/src/lib/env.ts`. This file used to duplicate that list and drifted out
# of date (missing Redis / AI / Stripe / API_PUBLIC_URL), so it now just points there
# instead of being a second source of truth to keep in sync.
#
# Local dev:
#   • Preferred: `npm run dev:infisical` from the repo root — Infisical injects all
#     secrets. You do NOT need an `apps/api/.env` at all.
#   • Non-secret local config (local DATABASE_URL, localhost URLs) lives in the repo
#     root `.env`. See the reduced-`.env` template and the three-store ownership model
#     in docs/FamLink_Secrets_Runbook.md → "Local environment architecture".
#
# Env load order (see `src/loadEnv.ts`):
#   1) apps/api/.env  (optional — only if you want API-only overrides)
#   2) repo root .env
#   3) repo root .env.local
#
# Secrets come from Infisical (local) / Railway (prod) — never from a committed
# template. Full inventory + rotation steps: docs/FamLink_Secrets_Runbook.md
# =============================================================================
